 null, "rationale": "A figure is not unreproducible until every named convention has been tried; an unnamed median or an unstated rounding chain can flip a sign or a decimal."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_corpus_docket_item35_withdrawn_figure_class", "label": "Docket Item 35 \u2014 Withdrawn Figure Re-Asserted", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/CORPUS/DOCKET.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Register's WARNING lines are the instrument that finds this class: read every WARNING on every cited entry before scoring a figure."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_corpus_docket_item36_unbibliographed_class", "label": "Docket Item 36 \u2014 the Unbibliographed-Attribution Class", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/CORPUS/DOCKET.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_corpus_docket_item37_reconstruction_vs_record", "label": "Docket Item 37 \u2014 the Reconstruction-Versus-Record Ledger", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/CORPUS/DOCKET.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When a reconstruction disagrees with the record, the finding is about the reconstruction \u2014 so a non-reproduction is filed against the instrument first, not the book."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_corpus_docket_item38_record_carried_class", "label": "Docket Item 38 \u2014 the Record-Carried Class", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/CORPUS/DOCKET.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Claims with no instrument in the bundle. Each delivered object is seated only with a validation block and a golden, so 